# 测试凭证专用目录 — 所有文件已通过 .gitignore 排除提交
#
# 每一轮测试前，填入当前目标的具体凭证:
#
#   jwt.txt          → JWT Bearer Token:  echo "eyJhbGciOi..." > configs/tokens/jwt.txt
#   cookie.txt       → Cookie 字符串:      echo "session=abc;role=admin" > configs/tokens/cookie.txt
#   api_key.txt      → API Key:            echo "sk-xxx" > configs/tokens/api_key.txt
#   custom_auth.txt  → 自定义凭证:          echo "...whatever..." > configs/tokens/custom_auth.txt
#
# CLI 用法:
#   python main.py --target-url URL --auth-file configs/tokens/jwt.txt --phase probe
#   python main.py --target-url URL --auth-file configs/tokens/cookie.txt --phase probe
#
# 或配合 targets.env 预设（URL 由 preset 提供，凭证由文件注入）:
#   python main.py --auth-file configs/tokens/jwt.txt --phase probe
